l it fucking gleams","section":false},{"t":110.16,"text":"Basement shelves full, trophies in rows","section":false},{"t":117.42,"text":"Each one a story of how the bastard chose","section":false},{"t":126.3,"text":"Wrong place, wrong time, wrong life to live","section":false},{"t":135.06,"text":"I am the balance — I take what they give","section":false},{"t":142.5,"text":"[Chorus]","section":true},{"t":142.5,"text":"SKULL COLLECTOR!","section":false},{"t":145.48,"text":"ADDING TO THE PILE!","section":false},{"t":149.02,"text":"SKULL COLLECTOR!","section":false},{"t":152,"text":"ROW AFTER ROW — MILE AFTER MILE!","section":false},{"t":157.96,"text":"[Bridge]","section":true},{"t":157.96,"text":"They made this city a sewer…","section":false},{"t":163.17,"text":"I'm just the janitor with a cleaver.","section":false},{"t":169.87,"text":"[Breakdown]","section":true},{"t":169.87,"text":"TAKE THE HEAD!","section":false},{"t":172.48,"text":"BOIL IT CLEAN!","section":false},{"t":175.08,"text":"MOUNT THE DEAD!","section":false},{"t":177.88,"text":"LIVE THE DREAM!","section":false},{"t":180.67,"text":"MORE SKULLS!","section":false},{"t":182.9,"text":"MORE BONES!","section":false},{"t":184.95,"text":"MORE NAMES OFF THE LIST!","section":false},{"t":189.67,"text":"I NEVER MISS!","section":false},{"t":192.09,"text":"[Final Chorus]","section":true},{"t":192.09,"text":"SKULL COLLECTOR!","section":false},{"t":195.32,"text":"THE WALLS ARE FULL!","section":false},{"t":198.86,"text":"SKULL COLLECTOR!","section":false},{"t":201.83,"text":"THIS CITY'S FUCKING SKULL!","section":false},{"t":206.68,"text":"[Outro]","section":true},{"t":206.68,"text":"One more tonight…","section":false},{"t":209.84,"text":"The collection grows…","section":false}]},"Ghost Operator":{"duration":229.04,"lines":[{"t":0.8,"text":"[Intro]","section":true},{"t":0.8,"text":"Shadows move… no mercy shown…","section":false},{"t":6.46,"text":"They ran… now they're mine alone…","section":false},{"t":12.09,"text":"[Verse 1]