 ON THE LUNGS!","section":false},{"t":210.75,"text":"RIP OUT THE TONGUE!","section":false},{"t":213.78,"text":"FED TO THE DOGS!","section":false},{"t":216.57,"text":"DOGS LOVE RATS!","section":false},{"t":218.96,"text":"ANOTHER ONE DEAD!","section":false},{"t":221.66,"text":"[Outro]","section":true},{"t":221.66,"text":"Belly full…","section":false},{"t":223.41,"text":"Snitch dead…","section":false},{"t":225.44,"text":"Good dog.","section":false}]},"Hung On The Hook":{"duration":211.08,"lines":[{"t":0.8,"text":"[Intro]","section":true},{"t":0.8,"text":"Lights out in the plant…","section":false},{"t":3.51,"text":"Hooks still swing…","section":false},{"t":6.14,"text":"Tonight they work again…","section":false},{"t":9.65,"text":"[Verse 1]","section":true},{"t":9.65,"text":"Dragged through the doors with a bag on your head","section":false},{"t":16.81,"text":"Kicking and screaming, already half-dead","section":false},{"t":22.66,"text":"I hoist you up high on the rusted old rail","section":false},{"t":29.05,"text":"Meat hook through meat — you start to flail","section":false},{"t":35.34,"text":"The chain starts to turn, your body swings slow","section":false},{"t":42.46,"text":"Blood runs in lines down the concrete below","section":false},{"t":48.75,"text":"I sharpen the knives while you beg and you choke","section":false},{"t":55.76,"text":"This is the place where the soft ones get broke","section":false},{"t":62.64,"text":"[Chorus]","section":true},{"t":62.64,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":65.12,"text":"SWINGING IN THE DARK!","section":false},{"t":68.19,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":70.68,"text":"RIPPED STRAIGHT APART!","section":false},{"t":73.89,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":76.38,"text":"NO ONE WILL LOOK!","section":false},{"t":78.86,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":81.35,"text":"[Verse 2]","section":true},{"t":81.35,"text":"Saw through the bone like I've done it before","section":false},{"t":87.93,"text":"Strip off the skin, leave it piled on the floor","section":false},{"t":94.8,"text":"Organs drop wet in the bucket below","section":false},{"t":99.92,"text":"Everything used — nothing left for the crows","section":false},{"t":106.35,"text":"You thought you were human, you thought you had rights","section":false},{"t":114.25,"text":"Out here you're just weight on a cold winter night","section":false},{"t":122.06,"text":"I hose down the floor when the work is complete","section":false},{"t":128.93,"text":"Another one processed, another one meat","section":false},{"t":134.63,"text":"[Chorus]","section":true},{"t":134.63,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":137.11,"text":"SWINGING IN THE DARK!","section":false},{"t":140.19,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":142.67,"text":"RIPPED STRAIGHT APART!","section":false},{"t":145.89,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":148.37,"text":"NO ONE WILL LOOK!","section":false},{"t":150.86,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":153.34,"text":"[Bridge]","section":true},{"t":153.34,"text":"No names.","section":false},{"t":154.66,"text":"No prayers.","section":false},{"t":156.27,"text":"Just the sound of the chain…","section":false},{"t":160.36,"text":"and the dripping stairs.","section":false},{"t":163.87,"text":"[Breakdown]","section":true},{"t":163.87,"text":"HOOK!","section":false},{"t":165.04,"text":"HOIST!","section":false},{"t":166.21,"text":"CUT!","section":false},{"t":167.38,"text":"DRAIN!","section":false},{"t":168.55,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":171.03,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":173.52,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":176,"text":"NOTHING REMAINS!","section":false},{"t":178.34,"text":"[Final Chorus]","section":true},{"t":178.34,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":180.83,"text":"SWINGING IN THE DARK!","section":false},{"t":183.9,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":186.64,"text":"RIPPED STRAIGHT APART!","section":false},{"t":189.85,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":192.84,"text":"THE FLOOR STAYS RED!","section":false},{"t":197.76,"text":"HUNG ON THE HOOK!","section":false},{"t":200.5,"text":"ANOTHER ONE DEAD!","section":false},{"t":202.98,"text":"[Outro]","section":true},{"t":202.98,"text":"Lights out…","section":false},{"t":204.59,"text":"Hooks still swing…","section":false},{"t":207.22,"text":"Ready for the next.","section":false}]},"Trench Rot":{"duration":237.48,"lines":[{"t":0.8,"text":"[Intro]","section":true},{"t":0.8,"text":"Mud and blood… rats in my boots…","section":false},{"t":7.97,"text":"No gods here… only the rot…","section":false},{"t":13,"text":"[Verse 1]","section":true},{"t":13,"text":"Trenches filled with shit and decay","section":false},{"t":19.53,"text":"Bodies stacked high from yesterday","section":false},{"t":25.87,"text":"Gas masks cracking, lungs full of fire","section":false},{"t":33.45,"text":"Orders from rear — send us to die","section":false},{"t":39.61,"text":"Shells raining down, ears bleeding red","section":false},{"t":46.69,"text":"Friends turn to soup inside their heads","section":false},{"t":54.21,"text":"I chew on leather, swallow the pain","section":false},{"t":60.74,"text":"Kill or be killed — it's all the same","section":false},{"t":67.64,"text":"[Chorus]","section":true},{"t":67.64,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":71.93,"text":"WATCH YOUR SOUL ROT AWAY!","section":false},{"t":76.59,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":80.88,"text":"ANOTHER DAY IN THE GRAVE!","section":false},{"t":85.54,"text":"[Verse 2]","section":true},{"t":85.54,"text":"Bayonet in the gut, twist till it snaps","section":false},{"t":92.81,"text":"Eyes wide open in the poison gas","section":false},{"t":98.78,"text":"Rats eat the wounded while they still scream","section":false},{"t":106.98,"text":"I laugh through the madness — living the dream","section":false},{"t":115.56,"text":"No mercy, no glory, no end in sight","section":false},{"t":122.09,"text":"Just endless nights under flare light","section":false},{"t":128.99,"text":"I shoot my own sergeant, take his dry boots","section":false},{"t":137,"text":"The war machine grinds us down to roots","section":false},{"t":145.78,"text":"[Chorus]","section":true},{"t":145.78,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":153.82,"text":"WATCH YOUR SOUL ROT AWAY!","section":false},{"t":159.98,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":164.52,"text":"ANOTHER DAY IN THE GRAVE!","section":false},{"t":169.18,"text":"[Bridge]","section":true},{"t":169.18,"text":"No flags. No country. No tomorrow.","section":false},{"t":175.52,"text":"Just the smell of death… and the will to borrow one more breath.","section":false},{"t":187.45,"text":"[Breakdown]","section":true},{"t":187.45,"text":"EAT THE DEAD!","section":false},{"t":189.88,"text":"SLEEP IN THE MUD!","section":false},{"t":193.05,"text":"DRINK THE BLOOD!","section":false},{"t":196.03,"text":"BECOME THE FLOOD!","section":false},{"t":199.2,"text":"WAR NEVER ENDS!","section":false},{"t":202,"text":"MANKIND DESCENDS!","section":false},{"t":205.17,"text":"TRENCH ROT CLAIMS US ALL!","section":false},{"t":209.83,"text":"[Final Chorus]","section":true},{"t":209.83,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":214.12,"text":"NOTHING LEFT TO SAVE!","section":false},{"t":218.03,"text":"TRENCH ROT! TRENCH ROT!","section":false},{"t":222.32,"text":"WELCOME TO YOUR FUCKING GRAVE!","section":false},{"t":227.91,"text":"[Outro]","section":true},{"t":227.91,"text":"Still breathing…","section":false},{"t":230.9,"text":"Still killing…","section":false},{"t":233.76,"text":"Rot.","section":false}]}}